'''Aku Doge''' (デビルワン, ''Debiruwan'', '''Devilwan''') is an [[:Category:Aku Enemies|Aku]] variant of [[Doge]] that appears in [[The Aku Realms]] and [[Legend Stages]]. He was added in [[Version 10.8 Update|Version 10.8]].

