==Trivia==
*He is a reference to the titular character of the manga ''[[wikipedia:Devilman|Devilman]]'', not only in his design but also in his Japanese name, Devilwan (デビルワン ''Debiruwan''), a pun on ''Devilman'' and ワン ''wan'' (woof).
**The caption for the [https://www.instagram.com/p/CRlrE_oFQ8u/ Instagram post] teasing Aku Doge contains あっれはーだれっにゃ、だれっにゃ、だれっにゃ、あっれはー、デ… (''Arre wā darennya, darennya, arre wā, De...''), a parody of the first lyric in "[https://youtu.be/BLXq9D0RuGw Devilman no Uta]", the opening theme of both the 1972 ''Devilman'' anime and 2018's ''Devilman Crybaby''.
*He is the only [[Doge]] variant to have five teeth.

